<v Zoe Chace>你们一起发现的？

00:36:47.630 --> 00:37:07.430
<v Lynette Sharp>It was kind of-- it was a weird thing. A lady in the club posted something on Facebook about something about a sexual thing, and I commented on it, and Marshall texted me immediately and said, did you mean that? And I said, yes. And so we started talking. And that made us realize we'd been having sex wrong the whole time.
