<v Zoe Chace>Lynette was still going to church, but now in her Sons of Anarchy t-shirt. They didn't know what to make of her. In Lynette's next chapter of self-realization-- maybe you saw this coming-- she's watching Amber Heard in this movie The Rum Diary, and realizes, actually, she's always liked girls. And she gives Marshall an ultimatum.
